    <comment>New package comfyui for openSUSE:Factory from science:machinelearning (ComfyUI cone). pluskalm is the science:machinelearning package maintainer.

Requires python-av &gt;= 16 (Factory is 14.2.0 until sr#1372737). python-comfy-angle is Recommends only and is not packaged (prebuilt Electron libEGL/libGLESv2).

INTERDEPENDENT REQUESTS - please stage together (ComfyUI cone):
  * sr#1372780 python-trampoline
  * sr#1372737 python-av (devel:languages:python; Factory 14.2.0, need &gt;= 16 for comfyui)
  * remaining cone packages from science:machinelearning being submitted in this batch

Fri Aug 21 09:01:47 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal &lt;mpluskal@suse.com&gt;

- Initial package of ComfyUI 0.33.3: node-graph engine for local
  image, video, audio and 3D generation
  * Single-flavour application: tree in /usr/share/comfyui,
    launcher /usr/bin/comfyui
  * Launcher defaults --base-directory and --database-url to
    $XDG_DATA_HOME/comfyui (or ~/.local/share/comfyui)
  * Already includes the 0.28.0 security fixes:
    CVE-2026-56670, CVE-2026-56671, CVE-2026-56672, CVE-2026-56673
</comment>
